<title>USA: Howard Cty, Md. $5.1 mln won by Alex Brown.</title>
<headline>Howard Cty, Md. $5.1 mln won by Alex Brown.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex Brown &amp; Sons Inc., said it won $5.1 million of Howard Cty, Md., metropolitan district bonds, 1997 Series A, with a true interest cost of 5.47 percent.</p>
</text>
